1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:04,476
Elisabeth's Rebellion: a Character Pack for the Final Girl Elisabeth, captain of her

2
00:00:04,476 --> 00:00:05,420
cheerleading squad.

3
00:00:05,640 --> 00:00:08,047
She plays against any Killer at any Location.

4
00:00:08,047 --> 00:00:09,437
Here's how her pack works.

5
00:00:10,267 --> 00:00:14,057
Setup in brief. Replace all six Zero Cost Action cards with hers:

6
00:00:14,057 --> 00:00:17,264
Strut twice, Pep Talk twice, Self-Care and Gnarly Burn.

7
00:00:17,484 --> 00:00:21,539
In the Tableau, swap both Search cards for her two Window Shop cards, swap both

8
00:00:21,539 --> 00:00:24,567
Sprint cards for her two Swagger cards, and add Pump It Up!

9
00:00:24,787 --> 00:00:28,806
Put the Moxie card by your play area with a Tracking marker on two, and put one

10
00:00:28,806 --> 00:00:30,891
random Cheerleader Item in your Backpack.

11
00:00:30,891 --> 00:00:33,384
For an easier game, choose it, or start with two.

12
00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:38,665
Build the Item decks as normal. Then shuffle the remaining Cheerleader Items and put

13
00:00:38,665 --> 00:00:40,579
one faceup on top of each Item deck.

14
00:00:40,799 --> 00:00:44,371
So each deck has one extra card, and its top two cards are faceup:

15
00:00:44,371 --> 00:00:47,348
the Cheerleader Item, and the normal top card under it.

16
00:00:48,167 --> 00:00:52,402
Elisabeth has four health. Her first three saves each give two Moxie, the pink

17
00:00:52,402 --> 00:00:52,945
hand-sign.

18
00:00:53,165 --> 00:00:57,449
Her fourth save gives Time. Then you may flip her card to reveal her Ultimate, or

19
00:00:57,449 --> 00:01:01,733
keep saving Victims. Each extra save gives the small reward printed by that text,

20
00:01:01,733 --> 00:01:03,320
and you make the choice again.

21
00:01:03,540 --> 00:01:07,039
Once she's flipped, every additional Victim saved lowers Horror by one.

22
00:01:07,867 --> 00:01:12,005
Elisabeth isn't very fast, but she makes up for it with charm, leadership and moxie.

23
00:01:12,225 --> 00:01:14,619
All her new Action cards can generate Moxie.

24
00:01:14,619 --> 00:01:19,135
Whenever you resolve the pink hand-sign icon on a card, move the Tracking marker up

25
00:01:19,135 --> 00:01:20,332
one on the Moxie card.

26
00:01:20,552 --> 00:01:23,987
Moxie can't go above ten. Any more you'd gain beyond ten is lost.

27
00:01:24,800 --> 00:01:28,666
In the Action phase you can spend Moxie to move Victims, Allies and Enemies.

28
00:01:28,666 --> 00:01:31,413
Whatever you move must be in your space or next to it.

29
00:01:31,633 --> 00:01:36,124
Two Moxie moves a normal Victim one space, or pulls an Enemy one space towards you.

30
00:01:36,124 --> 00:01:39,911
Three moves any Victim, including special ones, or an Ally, one space.

31
00:01:40,131 --> 00:01:44,739
Four moves an Enemy one space in any direction, or takes the top Item in your space.

32
00:01:45,567 --> 00:01:48,823
Say a normal Victim is next to your space but heading the wrong way.

33
00:01:48,823 --> 00:01:52,607
Spend two Moxie to move them into your space, and they follow you from then on.

34
00:01:52,827 --> 00:01:57,204
If the Killer is next door, two Moxie pulls it one space towards you, maybe into a

35
00:01:57,204 --> 00:02:01,635
trap or onto a Location hazard. Four Moxie moves it one space anywhere, for example

36
00:02:01,635 --> 00:02:03,557
away from a Victim you're escorting.

37
00:02:04,367 --> 00:02:06,579
Elisabeth needs her cheerleading kit, fast.

38
00:02:06,579 --> 00:02:10,542
Whenever you move into a Search space with a Cheerleader Item showing faceup,

39
00:02:10,542 --> 00:02:12,857
immediately put that Item into your Backpack.

40
00:02:13,077 --> 00:02:16,832
You get it just by moving there. The rule sheet doesn't mention a Search card.

41
00:02:17,667 --> 00:02:21,764
Dummy's Guide to Cheering: Victims can be saved whenever they're on an Exit space,

42
00:02:21,764 --> 00:02:23,213
even if you're not with them.

43
00:02:23,433 --> 00:02:26,424
Spunky Kicks: when moving, you may move an extra space.

44
00:02:26,424 --> 00:02:30,938
Pom Poms can be held in one hand or two; each Upkeep, one hand gives one Moxie, two

45
00:02:30,938 --> 00:02:31,753
hands give two.

46
00:02:31,973 --> 00:02:35,405
The Homecoming Queen Tiara reduces every Moxie cost by one.

47
00:02:35,405 --> 00:02:38,371
The Cheer Bag lets you rearrange Items at any time.

48
00:02:38,371 --> 00:02:42,965
And with the Megaphone, a one-handed Item, your Moxie moves can target Victims,

49
00:02:42,965 --> 00:02:45,349
Allies and Enemies anywhere on the board.

50
00:02:46,167 --> 00:02:49,586
Some rules and effects mention Action cards you removed at setup.

51
00:02:49,586 --> 00:02:53,164
When that happens, apply the effect to her replacement card instead.

52
00:02:53,384 --> 00:02:57,590
Strut stands in for Walk, Pep Talk for Focus, Gnarly Burn for Weak Attack, Self-Care

53
00:02:57,590 --> 00:03:00,744
for Short Rest, Swagger for Sprint, and Window Shop for Search.

54
00:03:00,964 --> 00:03:04,740
Each one's exact effects are printed on the card, and most add Moxie.

55
00:03:05,567 --> 00:03:09,944
Her Ultimate is called Cheer Squad, assemble! Immediately place every Victim you

56
00:03:09,944 --> 00:03:14,540
have saved back on the board, at named spaces or Exit spaces of your choice, one per

57
00:03:14,540 --> 00:03:14,868
space.

58
00:03:15,088 --> 00:03:18,112
From now on, Victims may follow you into an Enemy's space.

59
00:03:18,112 --> 00:03:22,439
When a normal Victim enters an Enemy's space, remove that Victim from the board and

60
00:03:22,439 --> 00:03:25,307
deal one damage to the Enemy. Don't increase Bloodlust.

61
00:03:25,527 --> 00:03:28,705
So gather a crowd, then walk them into the Killer, one damage each.

62
00:03:29,533 --> 00:03:33,724
At Sunnydaze Mall, replace The Savior's Girl Event card with The Savior's Ex, and

63
00:03:33,724 --> 00:03:36,104
start the Savior's Trust at I Guess You're Ok.

64
00:03:36,324 --> 00:03:39,570
When it's drawn, the Victim closest to you becomes the Savior's Ex.

65
00:03:39,570 --> 00:03:42,041
She won't follow you and can't be moved with Moxie.

66
00:03:42,261 --> 00:03:46,720
In the Upkeep phase, before resolving a Trust card, move her one space closer to the

67
00:03:46,720 --> 00:03:49,428
Savior. If she's in his space, reduce Trust by one.

68
00:03:49,428 --> 00:03:51,392
If she leaves play, discard the card.

69
00:03:52,200 --> 00:03:54,837
A few tips. She's slow, so let Moxie do the walking:

70
00:03:54,837 --> 00:03:57,171
bring Victims to you rather than chasing them.

71
00:03:57,391 --> 00:04:00,296
Grab faceup Cheerleader Items as you pass Search spaces.

72
00:04:00,296 --> 00:04:03,876
The Megaphone and Tiara together give you control of the whole board.

73
00:04:04,096 --> 00:04:07,958
And the more Victims you've saved, the bigger your cheer squad when the Ultimate

74
00:04:07,958 --> 00:04:08,683
lands. Go team.

